speechtext:
If the minister is concerned about that, my disposition would be this.
[Mr. Martin (Essex East).}
As he did not speak in moving the motion, and as I have permitted earlier in this session. I would allow him to speak, but of course not to close the debate. The same course was followed in a previous debate this session. If there is any contest about that of course the matter can be discussed, but the principle of the deferred speech of a mover has been recognized from time to time.
